WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:15.320
When I woke up the next morning, I couldn't move.

2
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.861
"I must still be tired from all that swimming," I thought.

3
00:00:20.861 --> 00:00:23.442
But soon I discovered why I couldn't move.

4
00:00:24.322 --> 00:00:28.343
My body, arms, and legs were tied to the ground.

5
00:00:29.944 --> 00:00:33.586
Even my hair, which was long and thick, was tied down.

6
00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.128
I couldn't even move my head.

7
00:00:36.949 --> 00:00:39.551
"How strange," I said to myself.

8
00:00:39.571 --> 00:00:41.413
"I must be dreaming."

9
00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.656
The sun grew hot and shone in my eyes.

10
00:00:45.596 --> 00:00:47.318
All I could see was the sky.

11
00:00:48.699 --> 00:00:51.461
Soon, I felt something crawling on my left leg.

12
00:00:51.481 --> 00:00:54.564
"It must be a bug," I thought.

13
00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:57.927
It moved up my body almost to my chin.

14
00:00:58.687 --> 00:01:04.314
I looked down and, to my great surprise, saw a tiny man standing on my chest!

15
00:01:05.554 --> 00:01:10.636
He was about as big as my thumb, no more than 15 centimeters tall.

16
00:01:11.317 --> 00:01:13.998
In his hands, he held a bow and arrows.

17
00:01:14.698 --> 00:01:17.099
I felt many more little men crawling over me.

18
00:01:17.779 --> 00:01:22.041
In astonishment, I shouted very loudly, "Get off me, you insects!"

19
00:01:23.161 --> 00:01:26.263
They all jumped in alarm and screamed in terror.

20
00:01:26.963 --> 00:01:29.304
Some of the little men fell right off my body.

21
00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.401
I tried to loosen the ropes that held me down.

22
00:01:33.202 --> 00:01:37.404
Although the ropes were very thin, like thread, there were hundreds of them.

23
00:01:38.945 --> 00:01:41.487
Finally, I was able to free my left arm.

24
00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:44.408
The tiny men began to shoot arrows at me.

25
00:01:45.049 --> 00:01:47.010
Several arrows landed on my hand.

26
00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:49.731
Others hit my face and chest.

27
00:01:50.212 --> 00:01:50.852
"Stop that.

28
00:01:51.092 --> 00:01:51.593
It hurts!"

29
00:01:52.373 --> 00:01:53.133
I cried out.

30
00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:57.296
I decided to lie still and see what would happen next.

31
00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:01.662
The little people gradually became brave and came near me.

32
00:02:02.402 --> 00:02:04.363
They built a platform beside my head.

33
00:02:05.363 --> 00:02:09.845
One of them, an official of some kind, climbed onto the platform.

34
00:02:11.505 --> 00:02:16.267
He started speaking to me, but his language was not like any language I had heard before.

35
00:02:17.048 --> 00:02:18.768
The little men seemed friendly now.

36
00:02:18.788 --> 00:02:20.789
"I'm so hungry!"

37
00:02:21.489 --> 00:02:23.690
I said, but they didn't understand me.

38
00:02:24.491 --> 00:02:27.572
With my free hand, I used signs to ask for food.

39
00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.201
The men brought me baskets of many different foods.

40
00:02:31.862 --> 00:02:33.703
I also drank two barrels of wine.

41
00:02:34.723 --> 00:02:38.526
Another official spoke to me, making signs with his hands as he talked.

42
00:02:39.446 --> 00:02:42.568
I understood that they were going to take me to another place.

43
00:02:43.288 --> 00:02:44.349
I fell asleep again.

44
00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:50.132
Later, I found out that the wine had contained something to make me sleep.

45
00:02:50.952 --> 00:02:54.514
I also learned about the island and what had happened while I slept.

46
00:02:55.255 --> 00:02:56.936
The island was called Lilliput.

47
00:02:57.916 --> 00:03:03.838
Its king lived in a castle in Mildendo, the capital city, which had high walls around it.

48
00:03:04.998 --> 00:03:08.519
The people made a huge cart and put me on it when I was asleep.

49
00:03:09.339 --> 00:03:12.800
I found out that it took nine hundred men to lift me onto the cart.

50
00:03:13.561 --> 00:03:16.642
Fifteen hundred Lilliputian horses were needed to pull it.

51
00:03:17.682 --> 00:03:21.983
When we arrived near the city, the guards attached many chains to my ankle.

52
00:03:22.623 --> 00:03:24.784
Then they cut the ropes that tied me down.

53
00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.961
At last, I was able to stand up and stretch.

54
00:03:28.801 --> 00:03:31.883
But because of the chains, I could not move about much.

55
00:03:33.023 --> 00:03:36.845
We were near a very large building just outside the gates of Mildendo.

56
00:03:36.865 --> 00:03:41.867
"Well," I thought, "it seems this building is to be my home."

57
00:03:42.707 --> 00:03:46.088
It was big enough for me to crawl into and lie down inside it.

58
00:03:47.089 --> 00:03:50.850
From outside my new home, I had a good view of the countryside.

59
00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:55.352
The fields were tiny, like small flower beds in my garden in England.

60
00:03:56.124 --> 00:03:59.370
Even the tallest trees were only about two meters high.

61
00:04:00.152 --> 00:04:05.061
Lilliput was a beautiful place, and everything in it was unbelievably tiny.
